OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors set to vote to scrap
OL,4,Acity mayor role
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors are set to vote next week
OL,7,Fto scrap the role of elected mayor in
OL,8,FLeicester.
OL,10,FThe post, held by Labour's Sir Peter
OL,11,FSoulsby, would be abolished from 9 May
OL,12,F2027, if councillors back a proposed
OL,13,Fchange to the political structure of
OL,14,FLeicester City Council.
OL,16,FA report said the authority would
OL,17,Fswitch to a conventional leader and
OL,18,Fcabinet model of decision making under
OL,19,Fthe change.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
